              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omu bunaku obwo Hanania omuhanuuzi yaija ahari Asa omugabe wa Yuda, yaamugira ati: Ahabw'okuba oyesigire omugabe wa Siria, tiwaayesiga MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe, nikyo eihe ry'omugabe wa Siria rikukiriireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
